+ * SEP-2352 enforcement for every SDK function that presents client credentials to an
+ * authorization server. A credential carrying an `issuer` stamp (set by {@linkcode auth}
+ * on everything it saves, or seeded via a provider's `expectedIssuer`) may only be
+ * presented to that authorization server; anything else throws
+ * {@linkcode AuthorizationServerMismatchError} before a request is built or sent.
+ * Unstamped (legacy / unpinned) credentials are not restricted.
+ */
